{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_51E42E9D","title":"Luminita 4","entry":"Dlg_51E42E9D::entry","exit":"Dlg_51E42E9D::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_160D78C0","articyId":"72057752951735868","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Luminita Roe","text":"Oh, you know, just a little CorpSec hospitality visit. Busted in like I was running a bioweapons lab instead of selling ‘Make Your Soup Suck Less’ powder.","speakerId":"Ntt_4C148973","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, you know, just a little CorpSec hospitality visit. Busted in like I was running a bioweapons lab instead of selling ‘Make Your Soup Suck Less’ powder.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44445","byteOffset":31143912,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_D9E13BAB","articyId":"72057752951735882","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Luminita Roe","text":"Raided, trashed - real full-service experience. You should’ve seen the guy leading it, too. Had that classic CorpSec look—dead eyes, square jaw, haircut like he loses sleep over unauthorized font choices.","speakerId":"Ntt_4C148973","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Raided, trashed - real full-service experience. You should’ve seen the guy leading it, too. Had that classic CorpSec look—dead eyes, square jaw, haircut like he loses sleep over unauthorized font choices.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1225.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29204","byteOffset":18929352,"byteLength":552}},{"id":"DFr_9CDA58A9","articyId":"72057752951735924","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Luminita Roe","text":"Ridiculous is CorpSec thinking they actually got all my stock.","speakerId":"Ntt_4C148973","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ridiculous is CorpSec thinking they actually got all my stock.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3325.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16615","byteOffset":14180312,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_51575AC3","articyId":"72057752951735937","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Luminita Roe","text":"If I did, I wouldn’t be good at this.","speakerId":"Ntt_4C148973","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If I did, I wouldn’t be good at this.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":4225.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41129","byteOffset":29888016,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_3F8A113A","articyId":"72057606922836879","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Luminita Roe","text":"Ugh.","speakerId":"Ntt_4C148973","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ugh.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":-75.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46697","byteOffset":31998800,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_B8B7D783","articyId":"72057821671323574","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Luminita Roe","text":"If I wasn't, I wouldn’t be good at this.","speakerId":"Ntt_4C148973","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If I wasn't, I wouldn’t be good at this.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":4225.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43724","byteOffset":30871472,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_25A390D8","articyId":"72057752951735861","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What happened? You look tired.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What happened? You look tired.","TextSheVersion":"What happened? You look tired.","TextTheyVersion":"What happened? You look tired."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":275.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21282","byteOffset":15938376,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_4B3BDE14","articyId":"72057752951735875","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"They actually raided you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They actually raided you?","TextSheVersion":"They actually raided you?","TextTheyVersion":"They actually raided you?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":900.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48650","byteOffset":32741984,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_03233027","articyId":"72057752951735889","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And yet, here you are. Which means…","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And yet, here you are. Which means…","TextSheVersion":"And yet, here you are. Which means…","TextTheyVersion":"And yet, here you are. Which means…"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40787","byteOffset":29756936,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_E42B00CB","articyId":"72057752951735896","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Luminita Roe","text":"I slipped out before they even got through the door. Had an old service tunnel rigged as an escape route—past tense, ‘cause they found it and filled it with foamcrete. Real shame.","speakerId":"Ntt_4C148973","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I slipped out before they even got through the door. Had an old service tunnel rigged as an escape route—past tense, ‘cause they found it and filled it with foamcrete. Real shame.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1825.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50575","byteOffset":33474464,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_3CE1D3E0","articyId":"72057752951735903","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Where’d you hide out?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Where’d you hide out?","TextSheVersion":"Where’d you hide out?","TextTheyVersion":"Where’d you hide out?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2125.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17429","byteOffset":14482320,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_2C82B4C2","articyId":"72057752951735910","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Luminita Roe","text":"Spent six hours in an old vending machine shell. Someone even tried to buy a snack from me. Almost charged ‘em.","speakerId":"Ntt_4C148973","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Spent six hours in an old vending machine shell. Someone even tried to buy a snack from me. Almost charged ‘em.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2422.5322265625,"y":304.6625671386719},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38749","byteOffset":28992344,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_5FD88A58","articyId":"72057752951735917","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"That’s ridiculous.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That’s ridiculous.","TextSheVersion":"That’s ridiculous.","TextTheyVersion":"That’s ridiculous."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20040","byteOffset":15466536,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_01BA224C","articyId":"72057752951735930","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You really don’t know when to quit, do you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You really don’t know when to quit, do you?","TextSheVersion":"You really don’t know when to quit, do you?","TextTheyVersion":"You really don’t know when to quit, do you?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3925.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45537","byteOffset":31559616,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_2CE54D0C","articyId":"72057752951735944","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Smart. Did they get all your stock?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Smart. Did they get all your stock?","TextSheVersion":"Smart. Did they get all your stock?","TextTheyVersion":"Smart. Did they get all your stock?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19804","byteOffset":15374584,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_2AE953CA","articyId":"72057752951735970","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Luminita Roe","text":"Of course not.","speakerId":"Ntt_4C148973","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course not.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3325.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40374","byteOffset":29602792,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_15ED3A74","articyId":"72057821671323544","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","t